\pard\b\fs20 Feud for the Border Fortress\b0\par
\fs16\par
Whether one of the mightiest magi of his time will arrive in time on his faithful mount is uncertain: disputes over the outpost at the Kanderian border have led to a massive siege of the stronghold - the stronghold that brings power over trade and money. Gritting his teeth, the lord of this castle now defends his symbol of power and hopes that his faithful friend will help.\par
There are 2 teams: one team is in a camp just outside the castle. This team should try to steal the crown from the castle and sell it within a certain time (the countdown is shown by a counter in the top left corner). The second team is in the castle and has to defend the crown and finally beat back the attackers. After the countdown, the rescuing magus appears with mighty spells.\par
